  (text "SPINAL CORD / CIRCUIT CAPTURE IN PROGRESS\nTeensy carrier, four TTL buses, SPI IMU, 48 touch inputs and isolated sensor branches.\nNo controller firmware, cable timing, stop behaviour or hardware has been validated; no fabrication release."
